{
  "Name": "Okta - Authentication & Sessions - Unauthorized Access to an Okta Application",
  "Description": "Alert: Okta\nGroup: Authentication & Sessions\nMITRE ATT&CK: Initial Access / T1078\nSchedule: every 15 minutes over the previous 15 minutes (edit the scheduled search to change it)\nTuning: okta_user_allowlist / okta_ip_allowlist keys \"<login without domain>|Unauthorized Access to an Okta Application\" or \"<ip>|Unauthorized Access to an Okta Application\"\n\nIdentifies unauthorized access attempts to Okta applications.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/initial_access_okta_user_attempted_unauthorized_access/\n- https://github.com/elastic/detection-rules/blob/main/rules/integrations/okta/initial_access_okta_user_attempted_unauthorized_access.toml",
